想将B加入答案。但原答案ACDE不含B，用户问'行不行'可能意味着想添加B。由于用户没有明确说'改成'，confidence设为0.9。preserve_other_answers为true，因为用户只针对B。", "relation_to_active_object": "revise_answer_on_active_object", "target_object_ref": {"object_id": "historical:9474436148e22029", "object_type": "single_question"}}, "turn_status": "completed"}
