{"active_object_question_id": "", "active_object_ref": {}, "answer_authority_source": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "assistant_content_source": "", "capability": "tutorbot", "conversation_id": "tb_80a39bb4b0b94aaead02cedf", "correct_answer_present": false, "entry_surface": "near_real_http_ws_wechat_payload", "event_count": 163, "event_source": "tutorbot", "execution_engine": "tutorbot_runtime", "execution_path": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "is_correct": "", "learner_answer": "", "missing_trace_fields": [], "official_answer": "", "options_hash": "", "question_hash": "", "question_id": "", "question_lifecycle_decision": {"business_gate_result": "no_candidate", "decision_source": "none", "exact_question_blocked_reason": "", "llm_scene_candidate": null, "needs_clarification": false, "reason": "no deterministic scene and LLM proposal not applicable", "required_anchor_status": "", "scene": null, "scene_confidence": 0.0, "selected_skill_names": []}, "response_excerpt": "## 结论\n\n**三级配电**指总配电箱 → 分配电箱 → 开关箱 → 用电设备，**两级保护**指总配电箱和开关箱内各设一级漏电保护器。\n\n## 采分点\n\n- 三级配电：总配 → 分配 → 开关箱 → 设备，不得越级配电\n- 两级保护：总配电箱设一级漏保（总保），开关箱设一级漏保（末级保）\n- 开关箱漏保是最后一道防线，动作电流≤30mA，动作时间≤0.1s\n\n## 易错点\n\n- 分配电箱不设漏保，只在总配和开关箱设——这是常混淆的地方\n- 开关箱漏保必须做到\"一机一闸一漏...", "result_mode": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "result_seq": 161, "round_id": "QA30-NR-016", "session_active_object_ref": {"object_id": "tb_80a39bb4b0b94aaead02cedf", "object_type": "open_chat_topic", "source_turn_id": "turn_1780695795111_7f5ab3436e", "version": 1}, "terminal_status": "completed", "trace_complete": true, "trace_expectation": "open_world_teaching", "turn_id": "turn_1780695795111_7f5ab3436e", "turn_semantic_decision": {}, "turn_status": "completed"}
